# Rubix Lab node list - copy to hosts.txt and fill in your real addresses.
#
# One host per line:   <ip or hostname>  [role]
# Role is optional and defaults to "participant".
# Blank lines and anything after # are ignored.
#
# Roles used by the lab tooling:
#   quorum       - designated quorum node (signs transactions, must stay funded)
#   participant  - ordinary sender/receiver node
#   fullnode     - the dedicated fullnode for this environment
#   controller   - this machine (list it if it also runs a node)

# 10.0.0.11  quorum
# 10.0.0.12  quorum
# 10.0.0.13  quorum
# 10.0.0.20  participant
# 10.0.0.21  participant
# 10.0.0.22  participant
